{"4692400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Minefront", "steam_appid": 4692400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minefront.io is a competitive online 1v1 game inspired by Minesweeper, redesigned as a fast, tactical duel with real pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is divided into two phases. First comes the Mining phase, where you place mines on your opponent’s board and try to create a defense that is difficult to read. Then the Incursion begins: you must clear the enemy board before your opponent does, avoiding traps, managing your time, and making decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not just about clicking fast. Every number, every flag, and every mistake can change the outcome of the duel. A good read of the board can give you the win; a bad decision can cost you seconds, points, and control of the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online 1v1 matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mechanics inspired by classic Minesweeper, adapted for competitive duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two phases per match: Mining and Incursion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Normal mines and smoke mines with different effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scoring system, mistakes, streaks, and penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast, intense matches that are easy to replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable and exclusive avatars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ranking system to compete against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tournament mode and private matches with code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minefront.io keeps the essence of Minesweeper but turns it into a more competitive, modern, and strategic experience. Plan your defense, read your opponent’s board, and prove you can stay calm when every second counts.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minefront.